"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6183","sourceWorkId":"21645","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"一所私立高中的英语老师。她和她的学生冈田悠太有过一段浪漫的关系，最终在他20岁后嫁给了他。他们相恋4年，作为新婚夫妇共同生活了2年。她是一个像姐姐一样溺爱悠太的妻子，这让悠太很担心。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悠太在骑摩托车时出了事故，对方车主要求他支付一大笔赔偿金。正因如此，凉子决定在“夺”秘密工作。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"195886"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"30 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6183","sourceWorkId":"21645","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/cc14b6a8915969ff91b6f5987ff4477b12c87b23baacd878771f208b171d46f6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6b/6b877eb70a693b3cd3bfef85cc7f541ece9ca8121c46cfe8e9f6271ec9180eb8.webp","width":137,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"野々村 紗夜","creatorId":"vndb:s839","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s839","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s839","name":"佐倉 ゆき","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:63222","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c32608","characterName":"桜崎 藍菜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"195887","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"271250"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6184"],"vndbCharacterId":"c32608"},"originalCharacterName":"桜崎 藍菜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"23"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A newly wed housewife who is married for one year. She dated Keigo who is her senior at school, and married him after she graduated. Her desire is to build an ordinary but happy family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"But one day, Keigo's workplace got bankrupt, and a part of the debt was pushed to him. Manami from Ubai approached her alone, but Aina decided to talk about it with his husband. In the end, the couple decided to open the gate to end their troubles, which is Ubai."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c32608"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"結婚１年の新婚、専業主婦。大学の先輩だった圭吾とつき合い、卒業後に結婚した。ごく普通の家庭を築き、ごく普通の幸せを望んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だがある日、圭吾の勤める会社が倒産。しかも借金の一部を押しつけられてしまう。「奪（愛海）」は当初藍菜１人に接触したが、彼女は「夫婦で相談して決める」と圭吾に打ち明け、苦悩の末２人で「奪」の門を叩いた。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6184","sourceWorkId":"21645","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"新婚一年的家庭主妇。她和她的学长樱崎圭吾相恋，毕业后嫁给了他。她的愿望是建立一个平凡美满的幸福家庭。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"但有一天，圭吾所在公司破产了，部分债务被推给了他。这时“夺”的爱海接近了蓝菜，但她决定和丈夫谈谈这件事。最后，这对夫妇决定打开“夺”的大门结束他们的债务危机。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"195887"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"23 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6184","sourceWorkId":"21645","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/537138cc403adf6b85a62553e2168aebc935c04ccae899f12f1aa69e128372eb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cb/cbb1596b4bb7e39c1b04f8aa9b64bdb097c387671f7b2231df8eda6e15dc2877.webp","width":159,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"唯香","creatorId":"vndb:s338","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s338","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s338","name":"山口 瑞樹","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:63221","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c65073","characterName":"飯島 亮介","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"195883","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"271250"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6182"],"vndbCharacterId":"c65073"},"originalCharacterName":"飯島 亮介","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"25"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"25 years old (Ubai)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"26 years old (Ubai Again)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"27 years old (Ubai Ending)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Wishes to be a cameraman, so he got employed at a video production company, but due to a scandal involving a woman, the said company went bankrupt."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The scandal was widely known, so he was having a hard time getting reemployed. It was at the time that Ubai picked him up."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because he was a newbie, he did miscellaneous jobs, and sometimes even worked as an AV actor. He was also like an assistant director."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Has a fetish for \"women's adultery\", and so he gets excited with both \"netori\" and \"netorare\". He is Asami's ex-boyfriend."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Sites 1,2,3"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65073"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「奪」の男優兼カメラマン兼ＡＤ。女の裏切りに興奮する性癖があり、そのため寝取り、寝取られどちらもいける。いっそ自分が当事者でなくてもいいという、ちょっと困った部分も。このために「奪」の裏の仕事に惹かれ、離れられない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"半年前の仕事を経て、より「奪」の深みに足を踏み入れようと決意。自ら積極的に女を堕とすことに挑戦する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6182","sourceWorkId":"21645","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"麻美的前男友。他由于当摄影师的梦想，而在一家视频制作公司工作。但由于涉及一名女性的丑闻，公司破产。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在他难以重新就业的时候，“夺”接受了他。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"作为新手，他做过各种各样的工作，不仅兼职助理导演，有时甚至当AV演员。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他对看人妻出轨有特殊癖好，对“netori”和“netorare”都很兴奋。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"195883"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f5/f5482c428d1ee9ce228027bbcc832183e77ec8c8191c292be9