confession to Aina was the biggest challenge of his life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His character was taken advantage of, and when the company he worked for went bankrupt, he was forced to take part of the debt."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After a long period of anguish, he and Aina knock on the door of “netorare” together."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c150263"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c29439","characterName":"露口 愛海","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c29439"},"originalCharacterName":"露口 愛海","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"25"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A manager at Ubai who handles the makeup of actresses, lighting, and sometimes camera work."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She also works as a model and has nude pictures of her taken, but without showing her face."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her work in the other Ubai includes scouting, client relations, and investigation. For some reason, she can sniff out women who can potentially work at Ubai, or people who might be interested in becoming members. She was also the one who found Ryousuke and recruited him to work under her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She looks at society with mocking eyes, and is a sarcastic person."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At Ubai Again, she incited Ryousuke, and will decide whether he has what it takes to follow through Gen's footsteps."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Manami is a child born from the adultery of her mother with Gen. She uses this info as blackmail to have sex with Gen whenever she wants."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Sites 1,2,3"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29439"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCa